182	           buttons pill, mark arc, palette cool-white-slate, type instrument, ground sky (lit), effect aurora-curtains in the hero frame
183	     moments: liquid-type on #statement (the six-word line the whole product rests on), iris-opens on #flip
184	              (the ground turns as the page turns to the fund's side) -->
185	
