222	<main id="top">
223	  <section class="hero hero--centred" data-enter aria-labelledby="hero-h">
224	    <div class="wrap"><div class="hero-text">
225	      <div class="hero__c">
226	        <a class="pill" href="#how"><span>Built on Cala's company graph</span><span class="muted">See the method</span></a>
227	        <h1 id="hero-h" aria-label="Who's a fit, and who has a conflict"><span class="mark" data-mark="arc" aria-hidden="true"></span> Who's a fit, and who has a conflict</h1>
228	        <p class="hero__lead">From either side of the table. Founders see which funds backed their direct competitors. Funds see which startups compete with their portfolio. For Sensofusion that is 9 funds to skip and 26 to pitch.</p>
229	        <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/">Check your investors</a><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/?mode=investor">Check a startup</a><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/founder/202e9283-6455-486f-8868-03c7e0d0cf29">Open a sample report</a></div>
230	      </div>
231	      <div class="hero__window" data-fx="aurora-curtains" data-fx-seed="7" data-fx-palette='{"bg":"#cfe0e2","surface":"#e4eef0","ink":"#1f3038","muted":"#5d6b72","accent":"#0d7480","accentInk":"#ffffff"}' role="img" aria-label="Sensofusion's founder report: 9 investors to skip, among them Skyfall Ventures, which backed the competitor Stendr, and Maki.vc at the top of the Pitch list with 70">
232	        <div class="ly-piece pw pw--hero" aria-hidden="true">
233	          <div class="pw__bar"><span class="pw__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><b>Sensofusion Oy</b><span>Founder report</span><span class="sp"></span><span>Finland</span></div>
234	          <div class="pw__body">
235	            <div class="pw__side">
236	              <span class="pw__label">Competitors · 4</span>
237	              <div class="pw__chips"><span class="pw__chip">MyDefence <s>×</s></span><span class="pw__chip">Stendr <s>×</s></span><span class="pw__chip">Frankenburg Technologies <s>×</s></span><span class="pw__chip">Origin Robotics <s>×</s></span></div>
238	            </div>
239	            <div class="pw__main" data-ly-steps="900">
240	              <p class="pw__verdict"><u>9 investors to skip</u>, because they backed one of your 4 direct competitors. 26 to pitch.</p>
241	              <div class="pw__row" data-step><span class="pw__tag">Skip</span><b>Skyfall Ventures</b><span>Backed your competitor Stendr</span><span class="pw__src"><em>Aggregator</em> tracxn.com</span></div>
242	              <div class="pw__row" data-step><span class="pw__tag">Skip</span><b>Change Ventures</b><span>Backed your competitor Origin Robotics</span><span class="pw__src"><em>Unrated</em> venturebets.io</span></div>
243	              <div class="pw__row" data-step><span class="pw__tag pw__tag--pitch">Pitch</span><b>Maki.vc</b><span>Led 2 of 2 rounds in your space</span><span class="pw__score">70</span></div>
244	            </div>
245	          </div>
246	        </div>
247	      </div>
248	    </div></div>
