251	  <section class="section" id="report" aria-labelledby="report-h">
252	    <div class="wrap">
253	      <div class="grid">
254	        <h2 class="span-5" id="report-h">Every fund in your space, ranked or ruled out</h2>
255	        <p class="span-6 start-7 muted t-lead">Cala lists who backed your rivals. Funds with a conflict go to Skip with the page that proves it; the rest are ranked to Pitch. <a class="link" href="/founder/202e9283-6455-486f-8868-03c7e0d0cf29">Open Sensofusion's report</a></p>
256	      </div>
257	      <div class="ui app fill" role="img" aria-label="The founder report as a window: the investor list with Skyfall Ventures open, its conflict with Stendr and the sources behind it" data-ui-pause-host>
258	        <div class="app__pane app__pane--list" aria-hidden="true">
259	          <div class="inv__head"><b>Investors · 35</b><span class="inv__tabs"><span>Pitch 26</span><span class="is-on">Skip 9</span></span></div>
